# WHITELIST, not a blacklist.
# Everything is ignored by default. Only the two PWA files are ever publishable.
# This is deliberate: it makes it structurally impossible for a customer
# spreadsheet, a .gs backend file or a credential to reach this public repo,
# even by accident, even with "git add -A".
#
# R22 (03-Aug-2026): manifest.json + the four PNG icons were added so the app can
# be packaged as an installable APK. A TWA/APK generator fetches the manifest by
# URL and requires PNG icons — the old inline data: URI manifest with JPEG icons
# could not be packaged. These are app assets with no customer data in them, so
# the whitelist is widened by NAME, one file at a time, never by pattern.
#
*
!.gitignore
!index.html
!sw.js
!manifest.json
!icon-192.png
!icon-512.png
!icon-maskable-192.png
!icon-maskable-512.png
#
# R22.2 (03-Aug-2026): the cartoon character/badge PNGs (Sehgal_Hero_Extracted_
# Assets) now ship with the app under assets/. The unignore is restricted to
# *.png inside that one folder — a spreadsheet, .gs or credential file dropped
# there would still be ignored, so the structural guarantee holds.
!assets/
!assets/*.png
# R22.2: digital asset links for the Android TWA package — without this file at
# /.well-known/assetlinks.json the installed APK shows a browser URL bar.
!.well-known/
!.well-known/assetlinks.json
# .nojekyll: Pages' Jekyll build silently DROPS dot-folders, so without this
# file /.well-known/assetlinks.json 404s and the APK grows a browser URL bar.
!.nojekyll
#
# R27 (04-Aug-2026): CLAUDE.md carries Ravi's Level 5 IIMK Human communication
# standard and the project's working rules. It has to be committed, because that
# is the only way it loads automatically at the start of every future session —
# that is the whole point of it. Widened by NAME, one file, per the rule above.
#
# NOTE: this repo is public, so CLAUDE.md is readable by anyone. It deliberately
# holds NO customer data, credentials, GCP project numbers, sheet IDs, .gs code
# or personal data — only working rules, architecture notes and house style.
# Keep it that way. Anything confidential belongs somewhere else.
!CLAUDE.md
